Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi (>= 3.42), python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), libglib2.0-bin, libx11-6
Recommends: gnome-shell
Maintainer: Nova Launcher <sureshkalla554@gmail.com>
Description: Fast macOS-inspired launcher for GNOME
 A lightweight GTK 4 / libadwaita application launcher with a magnifying
 dock (X11), a Launchpad-style application grid, an instant quick-search
 window and read-only diagnostics for slow application and Files start-up.
